# Tech stack

Use this stack only. Do not swap frameworks, ORMs, UI kits, or package managers.

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| Framework | Next.js 14+ App Router, TypeScript |
| DB | PostgreSQL + pgvector |
| ORM | Prisma |
| UI | Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui |
| Dataset gen / eval | Anthropic or OpenAI API |
| Local RAG model | Ollama `Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct` (`localhost:11434`) |
| Fine-tune | Python + Unsloth QLoRA in `/training-service` |
| Packages | pnpm |

```bash
# ✅
pnpm add zod
pnpm prisma migrate dev

# ❌
npm install
yarn add
npx create-next-app   # unless scaffolding M0 with pnpm
```

- Add shadcn components with the project's shadcn CLI (`pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add …`). Avoid custom CSS.
- Call Ollama for Playground answers; use Anthropic/OpenAI only for training-example generation and evaluation.
- Trigger Unsloth from Next.js via `child_process` or HTTP to `/training-service` — never inline training in a Next.js route handler.
- Keep `DATABASE_URL`, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` / `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` in `.env`. Names in English.
